":"assigned","id":20769165118,"intent":null,"node_id":"AE_lADOCTkjjc7WY-DNzwAAAATV8E8-","performed_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/20769165118"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38662446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johannahaffner","id":38662446,"login":"johannahaffner","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NjYyNDQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner","user_view_type":"public"},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Thank you for the thorough explanation! That does make a lot of sense to me. \n\nWhat I do find interesting is that whether or not the compiler makes this optimisation seems to have something to do with the size of the input array. Is that expected? Our most frequent use case is reporting on errata such as failed linear solves coming from another library, and for these use cases we have not yet seen it break. \n\nThanks for suggesting the workaround! I agree that that sounds a bit brittle, perhaps we'll still find another way. \n\nThanks again!","created_at":"2025-11-06T20:13:09Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/33147#issuecomment-3499220188","id":3499220188,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33147","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7Qkdzc","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3499220188/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-11-06T20:13:09Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3499220188","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38662446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johannahaffner","id":38662446,"login":"johannahaffner","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NjYyNDQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannahaffner","user_view_type":"public"}},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"I'm not certain why the compiler elides the callback in one case but not the other: the set of heuristics the compiler uses is large and always growing!\n\nYou could probably focus on just the jit-compiled `step` function to narrow-down the difference.","created_at":"2025-11-06T20:18:05Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/33147#issuecomment-3499235598","id":3499235598,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33147","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7QkhkO","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":1,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3499235598/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-11-06T20:18:05Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3499235598","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Also - you might want to check out [`jax.experimental.io_callback`](https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/_autosummary/jax.experimental.io_callback.html): this is a callback where the function explicitly has side-effects, and so the compiler shouldn't elide it.\n\nThere are still problems with raising an error at runtime, particularly on accelerators like TPU that don't support runtime aborts. Using this for `error_if` might fix some issues compared to `pure_callback`, but overall the behavior is still not well-defined.","created_at":"2025-11-06T20:20:50Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/33147#issuecomment-3499244614","id":3499244614,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33147","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7QkjxG","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":nul